WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.360
Mamas with babies in the back seat,

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:04.660
you're welcome.

00:00:04.661 --> 00:00:07.541
This is our new portable fan that we just got for our baby

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:09.381
because it's always hot in the back seat.

00:00:09.382 --> 00:00:11.941
This thing is super, super easy to rotate.

00:00:11.942 --> 00:00:13.941
The touch screen makes it easy to adjust.

00:00:13.942 --> 00:00:15.621
And this thing has some powder.

00:00:15.622 --> 00:00:17.301
That's part is that it doesn't have any cables.

00:00:17.302 --> 00:00:20.141
So you can just recharge it and take it anywhere you need to go.

00:00:20.142 --> 00:00:24.041
And on a single charge, you can get up to 12 hours of battery life.

00:00:24.042 --> 00:00:27.301
And so many portable fans over the years and they're just all junk.

00:00:27.302 --> 00:00:29.141
But this one's actually pretty solid.

00:00:29.142 --> 00:00:31.181
Only bad thing is they just launched on TikTok,

00:00:31.182 --> 00:00:32.901
so they don't have very many stock.

00:00:32.902 --> 00:00:34.381
So if you don't see that link right here,

00:00:34.382 --> 00:00:35.301
that means they're sold out.

00:00:35.302 --> 00:00:37.828
But if you do see, I look, grab two if you can.
